    "detailed_description": "\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748250/extras/8d6b124405dd91550bcf07dfd1dccc16.avif?t=1713535101\" width=389 height=163 /></span>.<br><br><strong>Curses and Blessings on the Land of Sweets. </strong><br><br><u>What this game contains</u>.<br>Sugar Time Paradigm is a multi-ending RPG made with RPG MAKER.<br><br>\u2219 Interact with NPCs to earn points and level up.<br>Explore the hand-drawn, pixel-art map.<br>Receive requests from NPCs. Sub-quests.<br>Front-view, command-and-select battles.<br>Over 100 recipes.<br>Time passing by actions.<br>Three multiple endings.<br><br><u>Story</u>.<br>In this peaceful country, a war is about to break out.<br>You start working in a pastry store to save money for your escape.<br>This is Sugarland, a land of sweets, where humans made of bones and flesh and Sugaries made of sugar live.<br>Please join us and witness the adventures and destiny that await an ordinary pastry shop.<br><br><br>\u3000\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748250/extras/42241feec0200203684045bb049f726a.avif?t=1713535101\" width=145 height=218 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748250/extras/2d06e724215a7b4715030da37837b11a.avif?t=1713535101\" width=100 height=104 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748250/extras/cookie.png ?t=1713535101\" width=100 height=104 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748250/extras/8d6b124405dd91550bcf07dfd1dccc16.avif?t=1713535101\" width=389 height=163 /></span>.<br><br><strong>Curses and Blessings on the Land of Sweets. </strong><br><br><u>What this game contains</u>.<br>Sugar Time Paradigm is a multi-ending RPG made with RPG MAKER.<br><br>\u2219 Interact with NPCs to earn points and level up.<br>Explore the hand-drawn, pixel-art map.<br>Receive requests from NPCs. Sub-quests.<br>Front-view, command-and-select battles.<br>Over 100 recipes.<br>Time passing by actions.<br>Three multiple endings.<br><br><u>Story</u>.<br>In this peaceful country, a war is about to break out.<br>You start working in a pastry store to save money for your escape.<br>This is Sugarland, a land of sweets, where humans made of bones and flesh and Sugaries made of sugar live.<br>Please join us and witness the adventures and destiny that await an ordinary pastry shop.<br><br><br>\u3000\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748250/extras/42241feec0200203684045bb049f726a.avif?t=1713535101\" width=145 height=218 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748250/extras/2d06e724215a7b4715030da37837b11a.avif?t=1713535101\" width=100 height=104 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748250/extras/cookie.png ?t=1713535101\" width=100 height=104 /></span>",
